rg
Usage: rg [-i] [-n] [-l] PATTERN [PATH]

ripgrep: searches a whole tree of files for a pattern, fast, skipping what you
would not want searched. The tool for sifting loot and the offline corpora --
find the one line, or the one file, that matters.

	-i          ignore case
	-n          show line numbers
	-l          just the names of files that match
	-A N / -B N   N lines of context after / before a match

See also: jq, grep
